WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:15.263
watched the chemical cloud move across more farm fields.

2
00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:18.745
Loud footsteps shook the ground.

3
00:00:18.765 --> 00:00:24.449
"I don't know if Blue Baboon is in that cloud," said Roxy.

4
00:00:24.469 --> 00:00:27.971
"But it's heading straight toward Metro City.

5
00:00:28.651 --> 00:00:29.872
I have to stop it!"

6
00:00:31.068 --> 00:00:33.169
Roxy flew fast toward the chemical cloud.

7
00:00:34.149 --> 00:00:35.130
It was now in Mr.

8
00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:36.070
Mann's cornfield.

9
00:00:39.012 --> 00:00:40.652
She took a deep breath and then blew.

10
00:00:41.473 --> 00:00:46.715
Whoosh! A huge hand popped out of the cloud and smacked Roxy.

11
00:00:47.515 --> 00:00:49.396
Whack! She tumbled through the air.

12
00:00:51.157 --> 00:00:53.138
By the time she landed, the cloud was gone.

13
00:00:54.878 --> 00:00:58.260
An enormous baboon, covered in glowing chemicals, stood in the field.

14
00:00:59.244 --> 00:01:00.745
The baboon was scratching himself.

15
00:01:01.526 --> 00:01:02.386
He looked angry.

16
00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:05.128
"Oh boy," said Roxy.

17
00:01:05.608 --> 00:01:07.490
"That's definitely Blue Baboon.

18
00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:10.371
But he's as tall as a building!

19
00:01:11.072 --> 00:01:13.233
The chemicals must have made him grow!"

20
00:01:13.253 --> 00:01:16.756
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

21
00:01:16.796 --> 00:01:17.836
Blue Baboon barked.

22
00:01:18.737 --> 00:01:22.139
The giant baboon scratched his side and then stomped toward Roxy.

23
00:01:23.981 --> 00:01:25.181
He opened his mouth wide.

24
00:01:25.742 --> 00:01:27.503
His fangs were huge and sharp.

25
00:01:29.196 --> 00:01:30.297
"Uh-oh!" Roxy cried.

26
00:01:31.217 --> 00:01:34.200
Blue Baboon swatted at Roxy, who quickly dodged the blow.

27
00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:36.901
The baboon barked again.

28
00:01:38.863 --> 00:01:40.784
Then he scratched and stomped on Mr.

29
00:01:40.804 --> 00:01:41.465
Mann's barn.

30
00:01:42.465 --> 00:01:45.448
Smash! The barn shattered into tiny pieces.

31
00:01:47.309 --> 00:01:48.730
Mr. Mann ran out of his house.

32
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.232
"What happened to my—?"

33
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.534
He looked up and saw Blue Baboon.

34
00:01:58.348 --> 00:01:58.608
"Aah!" Mr.

35
00:01:58.628 --> 00:02:01.029
Mann ran back into his house and hid under his bed.

36
00:02:01.049 --> 00:02:04.551
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

37
00:02:05.231 --> 00:02:06.772
Blue Baboon barked angrily.

38
00:02:07.632 --> 00:02:08.212
He stomped.

39
00:02:08.972 --> 00:02:09.713
He scratched.

40
00:02:09.733 --> 00:02:11.854
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

41
00:02:12.874 --> 00:02:15.035
Roxy watched Blue Baboon scratch his shoulder.

42
00:02:16.095 --> 00:02:18.516
Then he turned around and stomped across the field.

43
00:02:20.017 --> 00:02:21.778
He was heading toward Metro City again.

44
00:02:21.798 --> 00:02:25.920
"I can't let Blue Baboon reach Metro City!"

45
00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:26.800
Roxy thought.

46
00:02:27.616 --> 00:02:29.898
"He'll destroy every building in the city!"

47
00:02:31.539 --> 00:02:33.300
Roxy flew after the giant baboon.

48
00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:36.162
She wrapped her arms around his foot.

49
00:02:36.902 --> 00:02:38.603
Glowing chemicals got all over her.

50
00:02:40.225 --> 00:02:42.846
"Wah-hu!" Blue Baboon jerked his foot.

51
00:02:43.607 --> 00:02:44.647
He shook Roxy off.

52
00:02:45.308 --> 00:02:46.489
Then he kicked her hard.

53
00:02:47.609 --> 00:02:50.291
Roxy sailed through the air and crashed into a tractor.

54
00:02:51.152 --> 00:02:55.255
"Oof!" She stood up, still covered in the glowing chemicals.

55
00:02:56.455 --> 00:02:57.136
She scratched.

56
00:02:57.728 --> 00:02:59.109
Then she scratched some more.

57
00:02:59.129 --> 00:03:03.250
"Grr!" Roxy's face turned red.

58
00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:06.011
"Why am I so itchy?"

59
00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:08.652
She stomped her foot and scratched some more.

60
00:03:11.112 --> 00:03:12.573
Roxy gritted her teeth.

61
00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:15.494
"Ack! This is awful!

62
00:03:16.294 --> 00:03:17.534
I can't stop itching.

63
00:03:18.415 --> 00:03:21.656
I'm getting really, really angry!"
